Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:09:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] codex-wasm: the wasm entry crate (codex-wasm) and runtime
 fixes

wasm/: a cdylib reactor that the tab drives (codex_start, codex_tick, codex_host_wake),
loading config the standard way and running one thread; messages in, protocol events
out. Session files named in UTC on WASI; deeper recursion limit for core's async layouts.

